[00:00.00]The Nights - Avicii、Nicholas Furlong
[00:00.24]Lyrics by：Nicholas Furlong、Gabriel Benjamin、Jordan Suecof、John Feldmann、Tim Bergling、Ash Pournouri
[00:01.50]Composed by：Nicholas Furlong、Gabriel Benjamin、Jordan Suecof、John Feldmann、Tim Bergling、Ash Pournouri
[00:02.79]Once upon a younger year
[00:04.53]When all our shadows disappeared
[00:06.39]The animals inside came out to play
[00:10.14]When face to face with all our fears
[00:12.33]Learned our lessons through the tears
[00:14.03]Made memories we knew would never fade
[00:17.32]One day my father he told me
[00:19.42]Son don't let it slip away
[00:21.64]He took me in his arms I heard him say
[00:24.99]When you get older
[00:26.39]Your wild heart will live for younger days
[00:29.45]Think of me if ever you're afraid
[00:32.52]He said one day you'll leave this world behind
[00:36.28]So live a life you will remember
[00:40.20]My father told me when I was just a child
[00:43.97]These are the nights that never die
[00:47.39]My father told me
